Why: the comparator tail at 4 um, the first size tried, against the 0.5 um it has now
Run: convert CONVERT=build/convert/tt_27_nom/convert.txt
--- a/design/comparator_sizes.inc
+++ b/design/comparator_sizes.inc
@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@
